#: src/Playbook.php:366
msgid "Search for other affected accounts"
msgstr "Rechercher d'autres comptes touchés"

#: src/Playbook.php:366
msgid "Same source IP, same technique (LSASS dump, brute force…)."
msgstr "Même IP source, même technique (vidage LSASS, force brute…)."

#: src/Playbook.php:367
msgid "Remove the access added by the attacker"
msgstr "Supprimer les accès ajoutés par l'attaquant"

#: src/Playbook.php:367
msgid "Mailbox rules, authorized applications, API keys, added MFA methods, created accounts."
msgstr "Règles de messagerie, applications autorisées, clés API, MFA ajoutés, comptes créés."

#: src/Playbook.php:368
msgid "Re-enable with MFA"
msgstr "Réactiver avec MFA"

#: src/Playbook.php:368
msgid "New strong password, multi-factor authentication required."
msgstr "Nouveau mot de passe robuste, authentification multifacteur obligatoire."

#: src/Playbook.php:369
msgid "Depending on the data reachable from the account."
msgstr "Selon les données accessibles depuis le compte."

#: src/Playbook.php:370
msgid "Cause (password reuse, phishing, no MFA…) and corrective actions."
msgstr "Cause (réutilisation de mot de passe, hameçonnage, absence de MFA…) et actions correctives."

#: src/Playbook.php:376
msgid "EDR / antivirus detection of a malicious file or behaviour."
msgstr "Détection EDR / antivirus d'un fichier ou d'un comportement malveillant."

#: src/Playbook.php:378
msgid "Isolate the workstation"
msgstr "Isoler le poste"

#: src/Playbook.php:378
msgid "Network containment through the EDR if execution is confirmed."
msgstr "Confinement réseau via l'EDR si l'exécution est confirmée."

#: src/Playbook.php:379
msgid "Qualify the detection"
msgstr "Qualifier la détection"

#: src/Playbook.php:379
msgid "True or false positive, file executed or only blocked, parent process, user."
msgstr "Vrai ou faux positif, fichier exécuté ou seulement bloqué, processus parent, utilisateur."

#: src/Playbook.php:380
msgid "Search for the same indicator across the fleet"
msgstr "Rechercher le même indicateur sur le parc"

#: src/Playbook.php:380
msgid "Hash, file name, command line: add as an IOC and search in the EDR console."
msgstr "Hash, nom de fichier, ligne de commande : ajouter en IOC et chercher dans la console EDR."

#: src/Playbook.php:381
msgid "Clean or reinstall"
msgstr "Nettoyer ou réinstaller"

#: src/Playbook.php:381
msgid "Removal by the EDR and persistence check, or reinstallation if in doubt."
msgstr "Suppression par l'EDR et vérification de la persistance, ou réinstallation si doute."

#: src/Playbook.php:382
msgid "Lift the isolation"
msgstr "Lever l'isolement"

#: src/Playbook.php:382
msgid "After verification, reconnect and monitor."
msgstr "Après vérification, reconnecter et surveiller."

#: src/Playbook.php:383
msgid "Identify the origin"
msgstr "Identifier l'origine"

#: src/Playbook.php:383
msgid "Download, USB key, attachment… and preventive actions."
msgstr "Téléchargement, clé USB, pièce jointe… et actions préventives."

#: src/Playbook.php:387
msgid "Data leak"
msgstr "Fuite de données"

#: src/Playbook.php:389
msgid "Exfiltration, sent by mistake, public share, lost media."
msgstr "Exfiltration, envoi par erreur, partage public, perte de support."

#: src/Playbook.php:391
msgid "Stop the leak"
msgstr "Stopper la fuite"

#: src/Playbook.php:391
msgid "Remove the public share, block the exfiltration channel, ask the unauthorized recipient to delete the data."
msgstr "Retirer le partage public, bloquer le canal d'exfiltration, demander la suppression au destinataire non autorisé."

#: src/Playbook.php:392
msgid "Identify the data and the people affected"
msgstr "Identifier les données et les personnes concernées"

#: src/Playbook.php:392
msgid "Type of data, volume, number of people: to be entered in the GDPR / NIS2 tab."
msgstr "Nature des données, volume, nombre de personnes : à reporter dans l'onglet RGPD / NIS2."

#: src/Playbook.php:393
msgid "Access logs, copies of the exchanges, screenshots. Attach them to the incident."
msgstr "Journaux d'accès, copies des échanges, captures. Joindre à l'incident."

#: src/Playbook.php:394
msgid "CNIL notification within 72 h if there is a risk"
msgstr "Notification CNIL sous 72 h si risque"

#: src/Playbook.php:394
msgid "Document the risk analysis in all cases (breach register)."
msgstr "Documenter l'analyse de risque dans tous les cas (registre des violations)."

#: src/Playbook.php:395
msgid "Inform the people if the risk is high"
msgstr "Informer les personnes si risque élevé"

#: src/Playbook.php:395
msgid "Clear message: nature of the breach, consequences, measures taken, contact."
msgstr "Message clair : nature de la violation, conséquences, mesures prises, contact."

#: src/Playbook.php:396
msgid "Fix the cause"
msgstr "Corriger la cause"

#: src/Playbook.php:396
msgid "Access rights, configuration, media encryption, sending procedure."
msgstr "Droits d'accès, configuration, chiffrement des supports, procédure d'envoi."

#: src/Playbook.php:397
msgid "Update the procedures and raise awareness."
msgstr "Mettre à jour les procédures et sensibiliser."

#: src/Playbook.php:90 src/TimelineEvent.php:50
msgid "Analysis / investigation"
msgstr "Analyse / investigation"

#: src/Playbook.php:91
msgid "Notification / communication"
msgstr "Notification / communication"

#: src/Playbook.php:94
msgid "Post-incident / lessons learned"
msgstr "Après incident / retour d'expérience"

